    "RPG T1 1388402 reads 'Increases your pets attack power by 30'. Its equip aura 313223 must refresh 313224 (MOD_ATTACK_POWER 30,",
    "TARGET_UNIT_PET, 10 s) on the pet the way T2 317223 refreshes 317224, also after the pet is dismissed and summoned again.",
    "Base 415082 reads 'Increases your hunter pets attack power by 2': its equip aura 304131 must put 304132 on the pet."
  ],
